00:05:41.087 --> 00:05:42.980
- Yeah, so for all of you not in the know,

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:46.460
car raps is like a genre
that's super interesting.

00:05:46.460 --> 00:05:47.630
It just makes so much sense.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:51.288
