00:05:55.240 --> 00:05:57.400
that's in the back of
my car is the majority

00:05:57.400 --> 00:05:59.880
'cause we're so busy.
- Exactly.

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:01.910
- I've loved following that whole scene,

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:04.220
